          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通话、聊天详情和消失模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "核对码仅比较双方当前保存的群密钥状态，不认证成员身份，也不代表全群已验证。请当面或通过可信渠道核对；成员或纪元变化后需重新核对。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This code only compares locally saved group key state. It does not authenticate members or verify the whole group. Compare in person or over a trusted channel, and compare again after membership or epoch changes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "核对码仅比较双方当前保存的群密钥状态，不认证成员身份，也不代表全群已验证。请当面或通过可信渠道核对；成员或纪元变化后需重新核对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "群纪元核对二维码": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Group epoch comparison QR"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "群纪元核对二维码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "二维码生成失败，请点击刷新重试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unable to generate the QR. Refresh to retry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "二维码生成失败，请点击刷新重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "扫描群成员核对码": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan member comparison QR"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描群成员核对码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本次扫码一致，仅表示双方保存的该群纪元状态一致。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Matched this time: both devices saved the same group epoch state."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次扫码一致，仅表示双方保存的该群纪元状态一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "核对失败：群、纪元或密钥状态不一致，或二维码格式不受支持。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not matched: group, epoch or key state differs, or the QR format is unsupported."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "核对失败：群、纪元或密钥状态不一致，或二维码格式不受支持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机没有可核对的完整群密钥状态，暂不能生成安全码或二维码。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Complete local group key state is unavailable. A safety code and QR cannot be generated."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机没有可核对的完整群密钥状态，暂不能生成安全码或二维码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "群安全码与二维码": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Group safety code and QR"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "群安全码与二维码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IMIM v1 群纪元核对码，不是标准 MLS 纪元验证值或私聊安全码。二维码不包含群密钥。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IMIM v1 group epoch comparison, not a standard MLS epoch authenticator or private-chat safety code. The QR contains no group keys."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IMIM v1 群纪元核对码，不是标准 MLS 纪元验证值或私聊安全码。二维码不包含群密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MLS 群聊安全": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MLS group security"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MLS 群聊安全"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "群聊使用 MLS，不提供私聊的双人安全码。此页只读取本机状态，不代表全群已验证或所有成员已同步。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Group chats use MLS, not private-chat two-person safety codes. This page reads local state only; it does not verify the whole group or prove all members are synchronized."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "群聊使用 MLS，不提供私聊的双人安全码。此页只读取本机状态，不代表全群已验证或所有成员已同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开或刷新此页不会创建、导出或重置群密钥，也不会自动发起重新加群。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opening or refreshing this page does not create, export, or reset group keys, or automatically request to rejoin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开或刷新此页不会创建、导出或重置群密钥，也不会自动发起重新加群。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
