    "本机尚无此群的 MLS 状态。请等待已有成员设备正常同步群密钥后再刷新；刷新此页不能恢复已丢失的密钥。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No MLS state for this group on this device. Refresh after an existing member device synchronizes group keys. Refreshing this page cannot restore lost keys."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机尚无此群的 MLS 状态。请等待已有成员设备正常同步群密钥后再刷新；刷新此页不能恢复已丢失的密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
