    "语音仅在本机识别。按住输入栏说话，松开发送，上滑取消；右侧声波按钮开启连续对话，停顿后自动发送。识别文字会交给 DeepSeek，回复由系统朗读，不上传录音或其他私人聊天。离开页面或进入后台会停止麦克风。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speech is recognized on this device. Hold the input bar to speak, release to send, or slide up to cancel. The waveform button starts continuous conversation, which sends after a pause. Recognized text is sent to DeepSeek and replies are read aloud. Recordings and other private chats are not uploaded. Leaving this screen or going into the background stops the microphone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音仅在本机识别。按住输入栏说话，松开发送，上滑取消；右侧声波按钮开启连续对话，停顿后自动发送。识别文字会交给 DeepSeek，回复由系统朗读，不上传录音或其他私人聊天。离开页面或进入后台会停止麦克风。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
